<title>UK: Turkey sets 1.0 bln mark five-year bond, +250 bp. [CORRECTED 08:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 1.0 bln mark five-year bond, +250 bp. [CORRECTED 08:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TURKEY</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    23.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.875   PAY DATE    23.JUN.97</p>
<p>(Corrects ISS PRICE from 101.78.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+250 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA3	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  TURKEY    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     LISTING FEE 0.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
